   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**Rent** = alquiler (no «renta», que en español es ingreso). **Receipt** = recibo, ticket de compra (no «receta», que es **recipe**). **Figure** = cifra, cantidad.",
     "@en": "**Rent** = rental (no «renta», which in Spanish is income). **Receipt** = receipt, purchase ticket (not «recipe», which is **recipe**). **Figure** = number, amount."
    },
    {
     "@es": "En **fish pie**, **pie** = pastel de pescado; **pie** (el pie del cuerpo) = **foot**.",
     "@en": "In **fish pie**, **pie** = fish cake; **pie** (body foot) = **foot**."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Más falsos amigos",
    "@en": "Fake friends"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**Amazing** = increíble, sorprendente. **Lovely** = encantador, precioso. **Fabric** = tela, tejido (no «fábrica», que es **factory**).",
     "@en": "**Amazing** = amazing, amazing. **Lovely** = charming, beautiful. **Fabric** = fabric, fabric (not «factory», which is **factory**)."
    }
   ]
